# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — conan-init 对 CMake 项目误判构建系统 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-25
# Software: dsdcc 1.9.6
# Gate: conan-init → G2 conan create
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv
#   4. Write knowledge/doc/E0XX.md

id:                     DRAFT-dsdcc-conan-init-cmake-misdetect
trigger_tool:           conan-init|conanfile.py|cMake|autotools
phase:                  configuration
error_signature:        AutotoolsToolchain|conanfile.py.*Autotools|configure.*not found|
                         CMakeLists.txt exists but recipe uses autotools

severity:               2
category:               conan|recipe|build-system|cmake|autotools|ohos
match_keywords:         conan-init autotools template, CMake project misdetected,
                         build system guess, CMakeLists.txt, AutotoolsToolchain,
                         CMakeToolchain, recipe template wrong

title:                  conan-init 可能按 URL/注册表误判构建系统为 autotools, 而项目实为 CMake: 生成前必须核验源码根目录是否存在 CMakeLists.txt, 误判时改用手动 CMake 模板重写配方
error_excerpt:          ❌ 配方验证失败: G2  (conan create 使用 autotools 模板)
root_cause:             init-build/conan-init 的构建系统推断主要依据 URL 后缀与注册表(本任务 URL 为 github 归档, 被猜为 autotools), 未实际检查源码根目录的 CMakeLists.txt; 生成的 conanfile.py 使用 AutotoolsToolchain, 对 CMake 项目必然失败
rec_approach:           生成配方后核对源码根目录构建文件(CMakeLists.txt/Makefile/configure): 存在 CMakeLists.txt 时改用 templates/conanfile-cmake.py.tmpl 手动重写配方 (CMakeToolchain + cmake_layout), 再 conan-verify
verify_command:         python3 scripts/ohc-run.py conan-verify dsdcc 1.9.6
verify_exit_code:       0
vestigation_summary:    dsdcc 1.9.6 误判为 autotools, 重写为 CMake 模板后 conan create (G2)/G3/G4 全部通过
similar_to:             E007
applies_to:             任何 init-build 构建系统推断与源码实际不符的配方生成场景
boundary:               仅配方生成阶段; 若项目确有 configure 脚本则 autotools 模板正确